#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2013 expect=noViolation domain=MH
#note "MH is in the rule's Domains scope and --HLGTCD resolves to MHHLGTCD (Events-class model Variable Qualifier). Every populated MHHLGTCD is a High Level Group Term code of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary; the missing MHHLGTCD on row 3 does not fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset MH
col USUBJID  type=Char
col MHHLGT   type=Char
col MHHLGTCD type=Num
---
001 | Headaches                           | 10019233
001 | Gastrointestinal signs and symptoms | 10018012
002 | Headaches                           | .
